## Documentation namespace

`docs/_internal/` is the agent-facing reasoning record. A software repository has no
analysis stages to key memory to, and its issues and branches already partition the work,
so everything lives under one scope:

| Path | Holds |
|------|-------|
| `docs/_internal/_project/session.md` | where the work stopped |
| `docs/_internal/_project/<topic>.md` | one design decision, API choice or benchmark |
| `docs/_internal/_project/plans/<date-slug>/` | a phased plan: `00_INDEX.md` + `NN_<slug>.md` |

Create each directory with its first real file, and update `session.md` in place — an
in-place update keeps one current record instead of a dated pile, so write it knowing it
replaces what was there.

